      subItens: [{"titulo":"TEXTO 1","conteudo":"Signs of a Happy Person [IMAGEM: Uma mulher sorrindo, com um fundo de natureza em desfoque.] 1 Happy people live with purpose. They find joy in lasting relationships, working toward their goals, and living according to their values. The happy person is not enamored with material goods or 5 luxury vacations. This person is fine with the simple pleasures of life—petting a dog, sitting under a tree, enjoying a cup of tea. Here are a few of the outward signs that someone is content. • Is open to learning new things 10 • Is high in humility and patience • Smiles and laughs readily • Goes with the flow • Practices compassion 15 • Is often grateful • Exercises self-care • Enjoys healthy relationships • Is happy for other people • Gives and receives without torment 20 • Lives with meaning and purpose • Does not feel entitled and has fewer expectations • Is not spiteful or insulting • Does not hold grudges • Does not register small annoyances 25 • Does not angst over yesterday and tomorrow • Does not play games • Is not a martyr or victim • Is not stingy with their happiness Fonte: PSYCHOLOGY TODAY. Signs of a happy person. Psychology Today, New York: Sussex Publishers, 2023. Disponível em: <https://www.psychologytoday.com/ us/basics/happiness>. Acesso em: 20 maio 2023. O texto trata do tema felicidade sob a perspectiva da psicologia. Considerando o formato, o título, a gramática e o vocabulário apresentados, é correto afirmar que o objetivo desse texto é"}]
